(1. PROJECT TITLE & DOMAIN) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(Project Title   : TripNexus - Constraint-Aware Multi-Agent Travel Planner) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(Domain          : Artificial Intelligence, Distributed Multi-Agent Systems \(MAS\),) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(                  Full-Stack Web Engineering) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(Core Focus      : Autonomous Agent Coordination, Closed-Loop Evaluator Pattern,) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(                  Deterministic Tool Calculations, LLM Rate-Limit Resilience.) Tj
