(2. ABSTRACT & EXECUTIVE SUMMARY) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(Modern consumer travel planning is an intricate multi-criteria optimization) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(problem. Travelers must reconcile heterogeneous constraints: personal interests,) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(calendar dates, geographic proximity, strict group budgets in INR, and seasonal) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(climate risks.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
() Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(Single-prompt Large Language Model \(LLM\) interfaces fail consistently in this) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(domain due to four foundational flaws:) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(  1. Hallucinated destinations, non-existent venues, and fabricated pricing.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(  2. Severe arithmetic errors when computing multi-day multi-traveler budgets.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(  3. Context drift and inability to maintain strict chronological continuity.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(  4. Complete absence of self-critique, verification, and adaptive replanning.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
() Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(TripNexus solves these deficiencies by introducing an autonomous, distributed) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(multi-agent collaborative architecture. Built with TypeScript, Node.js, React 19,) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(and Groq Cloud LPU inference, TripNexus distributes travel planning across five) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(autonomous specialized agents. The system enforces strict separation between) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(non-deterministic LLM reasoning and deterministic mathematical computation,) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(incorporates an adversarial Critic Agent with closed-loop revision cycles, and) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(features an enterprise-grade resilient infrastructure with multi-key rotation,) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(multi-model failover, and zero-crash offline fallback mechanisms.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
() Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(3. PROBLEM STATEMENT & OBJECTIVES) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(Problem Statement:) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(Current online travel portals either rely on rigid, pre-packaged tour templates) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(or leave travelers to manually cross-reference map directions, seasonal weather) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(forecasts, and cost spreadsheets. Conversely, generic generative AI tools generate) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(stylistically pleasing but operationally unfeasible itineraries with unrealistic) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(transit times, conflicting budgets, and overlooked monsoon or extreme heat seasons.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
