(       b\) Budget Compliance: Checks total estimated cost against target budget.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(       c\) Route Sanity     : Flags excessive intra-day straight-line transit \(> 35 km\).) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(       d\) Weather Safety   : Detects unsheltered outdoor plans during heavy rain.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(   * Issues either an explicit APPROVED verdict or a REJECTED status with) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
(     actionable issue tickets specifying severity, responsible agent, and evidence.) Tj
0 -13.5 Td
() Tj
0 -13.5 Td
